2026-07-17 09:42:22,622 - agent_周原 - INFO - [FINALIZE CONTACT][year=2020 week=1 person=周原] [{'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Summary of the Contact Stage:  \n\nI sent three messages to 沈阑 — first asking if she goes to the canteen at lunch on D2, then repeating it (same wording), then shifting to a direct but low-pressure ask: “D2午休，我在一楼楼梯拐角等你。” No reply yet. That’s fine. She’s not the kind to rush a response — and I didn’t write anything that demanded one. Just a place, a time, no expectation spelled out. If she shows, she shows. If she doesn’t, it means either she’s not ready or she didn’t get the signal right — and that’s on me, not her. I’ll watch the stairs at 12:30. Not hovering. Just leaning against the wall, water bottle in hand, like I’m waiting for nobody in particular.  \n\nWith 郭明澄, I sent the same message twice: “明澄，D2午休我在楼梯口等你。不急，你忙完再说。” Simple. Clear. No pressure, no question mark, no hidden weight — just presence offered, not forced. He knows what “stairs” means: the narrow concrete landing between floors two and three, where light comes in sideways from the high windows and nobody ever lingers unless they mean to. It’s neutral ground. Not the classroom, not the teacher’s office, not the gym — just space where we’ve stood before, years ago, talking about nothing important while the bell rang somewhere else.  \n\nNo replies from either of them. Not surprising.沈阑 doesn’t owe me answers.郭明澄 hasn’t broken pattern yet — he still chooses silence over explanation, even with me. And that tells me something: whatever he’s holding isn’t light enough to lift alone, but it’s heavy enough that he won’t let anyone help carry it… unless he’s sure the hands are steady.  \n\nI didn’t propose any joint activities. Didn’t need to. What I’m doing isn’t social — it’s reconnaissance. Quiet. Ground-level. Like checking tension on a racket string before serving: you don’t shout about it, you press your thumb and feel.  \n\nThe contact stage wasn’t about getting answers.  \nIt was about laying down threads — thin, unobtrusive, easy to ignore if needed.  \nAnd seeing which ones hold.'}]
